{"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0003","content_sha256":"ae7dd78bd0314a4ba4d4ae88c68cb50aab7660c2bff0fcf887b97780e33099ba","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"S_t^2 = \\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{W,n,t} - ACAR_{W,t})^2 + \\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{L,n,t} - ACAR_{L,t})^2\\right] / 2(N-1)","surrounding_text":"we need a pooled estimate of the population variance in CAR_t","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"S_t^2 = \\left[\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{W,n,t} - ACAR_{W,t})^2 + \\sum_{n=1}^{N}(CAR_{L,n,t} - ACAR_{L,t})^2\\right] / 2(N-1)"}
{"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0004","content_sha256":"76bbc89c6d8ce19d2e538b9284e969b205f0d2b138a842b272fe67f81e6d355a","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"T_t = \\left[ACAR_{L,t} - ACAR_{W,t}\\right] / \\sqrt{2 S_t^2 / N}","surrounding_text":"With two samples of equal size N, the variance of the difference of sample means equals 2S_t^2/N and the t-statistic is therefore","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"T_t = \\left[ACAR_{L,t} - ACAR_{W,t}\\right] / \\sqrt{2 S_t^2 / N}"}
{"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0005","content_sha256":"8a3c2e4fc4810b815aad4da7ac687e38eb86b4667814a56093415cf6c0696a37","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"s_t = \\sqrt{\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(AR_{W,n,t} - AR_{W,t})^2 / N - 1}","surrounding_text":"The sample standard deviation of the winner portfolio is equal to","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"s_t = \\sqrt{\\sum_{n=1}^{N}(AR_{W,n,t} - AR_{W,t})^2 / N - 1}"}
{"asset_id":"fml-src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64-0006","content_sha256":"d686a846addb44de734e0e2a908fae07f55c35a59506ff23a13f1ad406e606a9","extractor":"visual_read_v1","fidelity":"transcribed","kind":"formula","page":7,"payload":{"image":"assets/page-0007.png","latex":"T_t = AR_{W,t} / (s_t / \\sqrt{N})","surrounding_text":"Since s_t/sqrt(N) represents the sample estimate of the standard error of AR_{W,t}, the t-statistic equals","transcribed":true},"source_id":"src-debondt-thaler-1985-overreact-d07fdf64","text":"T_t = AR_{W,t} / (s_t / \\sqrt{N})"}
